se and guys look at  this hot water  white vinegar a little baking soda and  some used lemons  your blender is as good as new  who wants margaritas if you're gonna  post this onto your social media we  would love it if you tagged the drew  barrymore show in your post  and be sure to check out more tips  tricks inspiration recipes and more  at the drew barrymore show.com and  always  don't forget i got my brand new magazine  naturally danny zio  now on newsstands actually the soup was  made in a blender  [Music]  you
 

